{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1503602-initial-exalted-essence-questions","id":1503602,"title":"Initial Exalted Essence Questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-02-21T00:17:12-08:00","id":1503602,"title":"Initial Exalted Essence Questions","content":"<br /> <br /> <b>So I have been reading through the preview of Exalted Essence and I had a few questions that I couldn't find an answer to:</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Say you have the charm Many-Attacks Technique, which says: \u201cSpend 2 motes on Step 1. After resolving a Close Combat attack, the character makes a second CloseCombat attack\u2026\u201d The rules for multiple attacks says that using such a charm resets the steps to step 1. Does this mean you can use an excellency (also a step 1 charm) on the second attack? Seems kinda odd that you can apply the excellency to the second attack but not the first.</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>How is an eclipse caste supposed to activate their iconic anima effect? It seems like a primarily out-of-combat effect, yet gaining anima outside of combat is pretty hard, and flat out impossible until essence 2+. Unless you can use build power actions outside of combat?</b><br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9124-satoshi","name":"satoshi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"282"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-21T04:39:30-08:00","id":1503613,"title":"","content":"(1) Getting an excellency on the second attack only is how we've been playing it.<br /> <br /> (2) You gain anima by spending motes so you just have to spend 2 motes on any Charm to get the effect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25834-habitableexoplanet","name":"habitableexoplanet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"296"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}